    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "24 Garden City is a spacious four-bedroom semi-detached home ideally located in the heart of Gorey town. Offering generous accommodation over two floors, together with an enclosed rear garden, this property presents an excellent opportunity for those looking to create a family home in a highly convenient town-centre location.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a welcoming front conservatory, home office, dining room, living room, kitchen and bathroom. The layout provides a good selection of living and working spaces, with the potential to adapt the accommodation to suit modern family life.\n\nUpstairs, there are four generously proportioned double bedrooms, a main family bathroom and a separate WC, providing excellent bedroom accommodation for a growing family.\n\nTo the rear, the property benefits from an enclosed garden, offering plenty of outdoor space for children, entertaining or gardening, with excellent potential to further enhance and develop the space.\n\nThe property is in need of some renovation and modernisation, providing the successful purchaser with an opportunity to put their own stamp on the home and create a property tailored to their individual tastes and requirements.\n\nSituated in the heart of Gorey town, the property is within easy reach of a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, supermarkets, leisure facilities and other local amenities. Its central location also provides convenient access to Gorey`s excellent transport links.\n\n24 Garden City offers generous accommodation, four double bedrooms and a substantial rear garden in an exceptionally convenient location, making it an exciting opportunity for those seeking a spacious home with scope for improvement."
      },
